{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.64]I know (I know)\n[00:06.62]I know how you feel, baby, trust me\n[00:09.00](Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[00:15.96]Like what’s your name? I love it (I love it)\n[00:19.64]You play these games, I love it (I love it)\n[00:22.70]Yeah, you say I'm not the same, I love it (I love it)\n[00:26.36]Yeah, I say I want your brain 'cause I love it (I love it)\n[00:30.78]I’m not in love but I love it (I love it)\n[00:34.52]I feel the rush and I love it (I love it)\n[00:37.42]Yeah, I could break your heart like it's nothing (Nothing)\n[00:41.18]Yeah, 'cause I'm not in love and I love it (I love it)\n[Verse 1]\n[00:45.66]I'm in that fast car swervin', yeah (Skrr)\n[00:49.42]Bitch, the scenery is perfect, yeah (Is perfect)\n[00:52.88]Like, oh my God, I love it, yeah (I love it)\n[00:56.64]She know I'm fly and she loves it, yeah (She loves it)\n[00:59.56]Your boy cool but he not me, ah (He not)\n[01:04.24]All this ice feel like hockey, yeah (Burr)\n[01:07.74]I'm knockin’ ’em out like Rocky (Like Rocky)\n[01:11.50]I get to that green, that broccoli (That broccoli)\n[01:15.22]I'm in that foreign, ain’t no pullin' over (In that foreign)\n[01:18.76]I broke your heart, no, we can't do it over (Ain't no doin’)\n[01:22.40]You funny girl, you tried to screw me over (Tried to screw me over)\n[01:26.14]You dummy girl, no, you can't screw me over (Oh, you can't screw me over)\n[01:29.76]Trix are for kids, not me (No)\n[01:33.34]I been through the most lately (Woah)\n[01:36.48]I know how you feel, baby, trust me\n[01:40.20]Yeah, but you made a mistake tryna love me (Lil' dummy)\n[Chorus]\n[01:44.58]Like what's your name? I love it (I love it)\n[01:48.26]You play these games, I love it (Yeah, I love it)\n[01:51.48]Yeah, you say I'm not the same, I love it (I love it)\n[01:54.98]Yeah, I say I want your brain 'cause I love it (I love it)\n[01:59.40]I'm not in love but I love it (I love it)\n[02:03.14]I feel the rush and I love it (I love it)\n[02:06.02]Yeah